WEBVTT

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:07.850
<i>World conquest.</i>

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.870
<i>Using military force or faith</i>

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.480
<i>to overturn the old order</i>

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:19.300
<i>and seize control of 
mankind and their future</i>

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:20.960
<i>does not count.</i>

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:25.770
<i>The notion of world conquest 
envisioned by leaders of the past</i>

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.380
<i>was nothing more than a delusion.</i>

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.340
<i>World conquest is</i>

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:36.800
<i>a glorious accomplishment that 
has never been achieved.</i>

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:44.150
<i>And no one truly understood how 
dreadful and stupendous a feat it was,</i>

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:48.790
<i>until one little girl named 
Hoshimiya Kate succeeded.</i>

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:58.760
<i>But now, there isn't a soul on this 
planet who doesn't understand.</i>

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:01.840
<i>The world was conquered.</i>

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:09.170
<i>May the light of Zvezda shine 
throughout this world.</i>

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.200
Can't go on...

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:46.790
I'm gonna die if I don't eat something...

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:57.680
<b>World Conquest</b>

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:57.680
<b>Zvezda Plot</b>

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.640
<b>24 Hours</b>

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:04.050
I could go home, but no one'll be there.

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:11.030
If you enjoy bossing 
people around so much,

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.400
why don't you go conquer the world?

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:18.760
You don't seem to care that you make 
a living by pissing people off,

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:22.030
but I want no part of the 
stinkin' family business!

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:28.620
Oh, really? Fine, then!

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:29.770
Stupid idiot!

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:30.830
Go to hell, old man!

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.320
<i>My name is Jimon Asuta.</i>

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:41.300
<i>I'm a second-year middle school student.</i>

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:44.290
<i>I have no permanent residence,</i>

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:45.650
<i>as of just now.</i>

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:49.130
<i>I guess I would be 
considered a runaway.</i>

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:52.360
Asuta-kun?

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.170
Oh, Komadori-san?

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:56.240
It really is you.

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:58.340
What are you doing here at this hour?

00:02:58.340 --> 00:02:59.620
Oh, uh...

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:01.620
<i>This is Renge-chan.</i>

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:04.450
<i>Komadori Renge-chan, 
a classmate of mine.</i>

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:06.370
On your way home from cram school?

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.500
I didn't go today...

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:12.010
What's with all the bags, Komadori-san?

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:12.990
Aren't they heavy?

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:14.280
Oh, I'm fine.

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.380
I'm stronger than I look.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:20.060
I was asked to do some quick shopping.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:23.830
Sounds like you have it rough at home.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.050
It's part of my mission.

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:26.510
Mission?

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:29.270
Er, I-I didn't say anything!

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:34.420
Oh, Class 2 Martial Law has 
been declared tonight,

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:36.230
so you need to get home.

00:03:37.580 --> 00:03:39.570
Want me to walk you home?

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:45.990
Save that stuff for your future 
girlfriend, Asuta-kun.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:55.770
Er, martial law?

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:06.150
Wait! Let me get some food!

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:15.250
Thank you so much! Thank you so much!

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:18.700
Can I get a bento and 
something to drink with this?

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.780
What? The card doesn't work?

00:04:23.350 --> 00:04:26.340
That old man canceled my card...

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.620
Oh, I was just talking to myself.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.450
Is this enough for anything?

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:43.210
I'm really screwed now.

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:45.510
Where do I go?

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:53.130
No luck anywhere.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:57.260
I'm starving, but I 
have to save this...

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:01.690
Is that the police?

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:02.900
Crap!

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.360
Are they gone?

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:42.040
H-Hello?

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:46.360
Hey...

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:56.330
I'm so hungry that I 
can't move an inch...

00:05:58.180 --> 00:05:59.670
<i>She just fell down on her own?!</i>

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:03.950
Am I going to die...

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:05.750
In this place...

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.350
Before realizing my dream...

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:13.350
Which one do you want?

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:16.890
This one is red bean 
and this one is pork.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.310
I think.

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:27.530
There's a saying.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.570
What goes around...

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.030
Comes around!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.520
Hey!

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:36.080
That was an admirable 
thing you did, boy.

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:36.950
Tell me your name.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.310
What?

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.710
Asuta. Jimon Asuta.

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:42.240
Asuta, is it?

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:44.250
And what about you?

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:46.510
Are you lost?

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.100
I'm not lost.

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.900
I'm on a top-secret reconnaissance 
mission right now.

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:53.480
I'm looking for something.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:55.860
So you're lost.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:59.640
Shouldn't you be going home, Asuta?

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.200
When you wander the streets at night,

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:04.650
you're considered a perp, not a runaway.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:05.930
How did you know that?

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.490
Do not fear my powerful insight.

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:12.740
Who is this snobby little kid?

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:15.900
My name is Hoshimiya Kate!

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.610
I am also known as the leader of

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:20.000
the secret society Zvezda, 
Venera the Great!

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:24.340
It appears that you have your reasons, boy.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.510
No matter, I won't ask any questions.

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:30.510
If you have nowhere to go, 
you are permitted to join me...

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:32.170
Look out!

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:37.290
Insolent wretch!

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.310
How dare you lay your hands on

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.010
the untouched body of a young 
girl without permission?!

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:45.560
Such perverse actions!

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.430
You abnormal sexual 
offenders are the reason

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:50.090
so many unnecessary laws get passed!

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:51.180
You must repent!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:52.520
Wh-What did you say?!

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:54.370
I'm not interested in children!

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:57.410
And how can you say that 
after I saved you?!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.990
You need to learn some manners!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.240
No matter, I forgive you.

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:05.960
I realize that young males have 
difficulty controlling their libido.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.210
You've got it all wrong...

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:10.810
Come with me, Jimon Asuta.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.090
I will show you my dream.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.640
A bigger dream than anyone else's.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.100
A dream?

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.310
Yes, a dream.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:26.520
A dream too big to be 
realized in a single lifetime.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:31.880
The ultimate ideal that both villains 
and legends failed to achieve.

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:33.300
That is...

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.070
"That is"...

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:39.240
World conquest.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:43.210
World... conquest?

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.000
Huh?!

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:53.970
Fool, it's too early.

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:56.390
But this should prove entertaining.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:08:59.310
What's that?

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:03.310
A mask and an Udo sweet bun?

00:09:04.340 --> 00:09:06.220
You have your own food!

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.400
This is special.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.150
If you swear fealty to me,

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:13.820
I shall share my snacks 
and the world with you.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:15.990
Huh?

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:18.170
My name is Hoshimiya Kate!

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:21.120
I am also known as the leader 
of the secret society Zvezda...

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.080
Venera, right? You already said that.

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:28.900
Now that you know my secret identity, 
I can't let you leave alive.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.460
You kinda volunteered to give it away.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.710
Will you swear fealty or die?

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.210
Which will you choose?

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:46.150
Good, you are now a member 
of Zvezda, Asuta.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.920
Your new nickname will be Dva.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.900
Address me as "Your Excellency."

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:52.860
Yeah, yeah.

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:54.790
Let's go, Dva!

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:56.020
Yeah, yeah...

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:04.490
<i>The Ground Self-Defense Force is 
currently engaged in battle with</i>

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:06.660
<i>what looks like a giant weapon that appeared in</i>

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:11.160
<b>Class 1 Martial Law in effect in West Udogawa</b>

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:09.600
<i>West Udogawa Memorial Park 
earlier this evening.</i>

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:13.010
<i>Martial law has been upgraded 
from Class 2 to Class 1.</i>

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:15.880
<i>The government has declared the area 
within a three kilometer radius to be a danger zone,</i>

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.210
What's going on?

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.320
<i>and movement in and out 
of the zone is banned.</i>

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:23.010
Why isn't there anyone around?

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:29.610
There she is!

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:32.560
Finally found her.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:35.440
That little brat had to run 
off when we're busy as hell.

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:39.820
This is actually pretty good.

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:40.990
Who's that guy?

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:43.400
Jimon Asuta?

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.720
Conquer level 5?

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:47.940
He's trash.

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:49.000
<b>Emergency Warning</b>

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:51.920
Plamya!

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:57.580
Roger that.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:09.980
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.980
<b>Episode 1               Conquer All Humans</b>

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:13.990
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.990
<b>Episode 1               Conquer All Humans</b>

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:21.240
There was another flash.

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:28.810
Hey, shouldn't you go home?

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:30.410
Isn't it past your bedtime?

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:33.970
Don't you have a secret base somewhere?

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.030
Of course!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:39.380
B-But there's a reason 
why I can't go back.

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:41.270
So you're also a runaway?

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:42.380
Thought so.

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:44.570
I'm not like you!

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:45.990
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:48.350
We can continue your world 
conquest game some other day.

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:50.790
Did you call this a game?!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:56.400
No...

00:11:57.760 --> 00:11:59.500
You might be right...

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:01.420
What's wrong now?

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:04.110
Oh, yeah. You mentioned that you 
were looking for something?

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.030
My friend and ally Galaktika.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:11.080
I dropped them somewhere when 
I left our secret base.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.040
Gala-what?

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:14.860
Galaktika.

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:17.910
It has round, blue eyes; pink fur

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:21.400
and these absolutely adorable fangs.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.760
Are we talking about a stuffed animal?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.020
I'm scared...

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:36.940
Once I begin, I can no 
longer stop or turn back.

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:41.010
There's only one thing I can do.

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:44.810
Yes, the one thing I've been dreaming 
about from the day I was born...

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:46.910
However...

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:50.890
Once I succeed in conquering the world,

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:53.220
will there be a place where I belong?

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:55.270
It worries me...

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:00.260
You're worrying about what might 
happen before you've even gotten started?

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:01.650
You must be pretty damn confident.

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:05.850
Hell, if you want to belong, 
you're just looking for acceptance,

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:07.180
and acceptance is a fickle thing.

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:10.010
It's very easy to find a 
replacement for someone.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:13.640
That's not a reason 
to conquer the world!

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:16.510
If you want people to dote on you,

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:20.500
just spend your life acting 
stupid, cute, and bright!

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:25.740
You have no idea how I feel!

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:28.670
No kidding! I'm not a mind reader!

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:30.120
Not to mention, we just met!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:34.490
H-Hey!

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:38.250
That's not safe!

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:43.130
<i>Damn, I was too harsh.</i>

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:45.970
<i>Why did I snap like that?</i>

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:17.400
Hey, innocent bystander.

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:20.420
Have you seen this stupid little kid?

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:24.130
Wh-What's this about?

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:27.040
You must know something.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:29.560
It's not in your interests 
to hide the truth!

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:30.900
Spit it out, damn it!

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:31.810
Plamya.

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:44.080
General Pepel, 
you keep your mouth shut.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:50.200
I wouldn't expect Lady Plamya, 
terror of the night, to harm an innocent.

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:52.050
What's that?

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:54.830
Do you realize who you're talking to?

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:05.800
May the light of Zvezda shine 
throughout this world!

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:14.930
Bastard! Where'd he go?!

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:19.920
Why are those people after her?

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:57.330
What's going on?

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:00.180
Just take 'em all out!

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:30.990
The giant unidentified 
creature has been disabled.

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:32.510
Don't let your guard down.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.030
It will only be temporary.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:35.310
Roger that.

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:36.730
Stay alert.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.110
Hello...

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:00.490
That's...

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.710
Wait, wait, wait!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.350
What?! Get off me, schoolboy!

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:12.340
I'm running for it!

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.130
I'd like to run away myself!

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:15.380
But look!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.340
Quiet!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.810
Stop! Stop!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.770
Hey! Hit the brakes!

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:48.920
We've discovered a man who is thought 
to be controlling the giant creature.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:53.940
He's a Zvezda soldier.

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:55.120
Capture him at once.

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:56.410
Roger that.

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:57.930
What's wrong?

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:01.930
That girl is our primary target!

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:15.910
It's just a toy.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.610
You could have left it out there.

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:24.060
But you can't be replaced, Jimon Asuta.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.960
And neither can I.

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:28.930
That's right.

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:33.800
No matter what anyone says, 
I own the ground I stand upon.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.490
That's the first step to 
conquering the world.

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.760
How could I have lost sight of that?

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:47.480
Hey, what are you up to?!

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.190
What can you possibly do by yourself?!

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.340
You're right.

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:53.980
I can't do anything by myself.

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:56.690
I need all of you!

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:59.200
So the world can be conquered!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:02.550
What are you trying to 
protect with your power?

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:05.400
Your family? Your nation? Your future?

00:19:06.150 --> 00:19:09.390
Tanks only help keep the worthless 
military industry around!

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:11.910
Law and order can only 
help keep the status quo!

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:14.820
The past is the only thing 
that can keep the peace!

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:17.700
There's only one thing that 
can protect this world!

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:18.740
Conquest!

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:19.930
Conquest is the only way!

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:23.120
The world seeks conquest!

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:25.310
I can hear its cries!

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:28.180
Conquest of conquest,

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.660
by conquest,

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:30.780
for conquest!

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:36.650
Y-You're just copying Lincoln!

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:38.650
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.020
Lincoln had potential.

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:53.070
However, his weakness 
was he couldn't handle bullets.

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:55.590
Conquered

00:20:12.510 --> 00:20:16.450
Conquest

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:18.530
time!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.720
<b>Conquered</b>

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:50.680
<b>JSDF West Udogawa 3rd Armored Brigade</b>

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:50.680
<b>Conquered</b>

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.280
Yasu.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:55.800
Ch-Chief?

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:59.860
So whatcha gonna do 
about this mess, eh?

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.980
I-I'm sorry!

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:07.230
Professor Um!

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:08.610
Right.

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:11.620
Don't try to tell me pressing 
the button to switch the

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:13.900
KuruKurus into their Armored 
Scorched Earth mode

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:17.540
was nothing more than 
an honest mistake!

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:20.000
Well, it really was a mistake...

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:23.050
Our plans have been ruined!

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:25.070
Do it, Roboko!

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:27.290
Understood. He will be purged.

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.730
Wait, we should allow Her 
Excellency to decide his fate.

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:38.210
Yasu...

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:43.650
As punishment, you don't 
get any dinner for a week!

00:21:43.970 --> 00:21:45.720
That's too cruel!

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:48.100
Anyway, I have someone to 
introduce to everyone.

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:53.040
This is our new soldier 
Dva, Jimi Asuta.

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:54.810
Good to have you.

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:56.290
Huh?

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:11.970
May the light of Zvezda shine 
throughout this world!

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:53.790
It appears that we were too late.

00:23:54.560 --> 00:23:57.580
Looks like it's time 
for us to get to work.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.420
<b>World Conquest
Zvezda Plot</b>

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:02.420
My name is Odin.

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:04.950
I am the man who will 
destroy this world.

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:08.330
I'm sure the creator of this world would

00:24:08.330 --> 00:24:11.290
be shocked to know it 
exists to be conquered.

00:24:11.290 --> 00:24:14.150
It's so much easier to just destroy it.

00:24:14.150 --> 00:24:16.810
But there's no turning back now.

00:24:17.200 --> 00:24:21.560
I'll get down and dirty 
with my blade to survive.

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:25.340
Here, Yasu, these fried shrimp 
tails were left over from dinner.

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.020
<b>Episode 2     From the Dining Table To the Grave</b>

00:24:25.340 --> 00:24:28.820
Thank you so much, Great one!
